    "Three add-to-cart attempts (Berkley Jensen Ultra Paper Towels PDP, Dude wipes via listing fulfilment drawer, Bounty Paper Towels PDP) produced no cart change; guest cart page reads 'Please sign in to see your items in cart.' Membership club may require sign-in to hold a cart.",
